Task: Retrieve the top 10 longest questions on Stack Overflow, measured by the length of their body text, where each question either has an accepted answer or has no accepted answer but has at least one answer with a score-to-view ratio exceeding 0.01. For each of these questions, include the reputation of the user who asked the question, the user's net votes (calculated as their total up_votes minus down_votes), and the total number of badges the user has earned.

